      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹11.99 (up from ₹1.81 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹11.9b (up 124% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹1.18b (up ₹996.5m from FY 2025). Profit margin: 9.9% (up from 3.4% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 28% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 25% per year.",
